{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/103200-looking-for-new-players-for-exalted-classic-edition-forum","id":103200,"title":"Looking for new players for Exalted Classic Edition Forum","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-03-31T23:04:48-07:00","id":103200,"title":"Looking for new players for Exalted Classic Edition Forum","content":"Currently we have three players and have had the equivalent of a single session over the period of three months. We had some players leave as they could not commit to posting in a timely manner. I am opening up the invitation to anyone on these forums.<br /> <br /> Game: Exalted<br /> Status: In progress, but slow going.<br /> Edition: First (with minor tweaks from second and possibly third)<br /> Format: Forum (min: once a week, max: once a day)<br /> Characters types: Solars (heroic)<br /> <br /> <br /> We are primarily using first edition but I'm not above borrowing other things from second or third if we can make them work. I've never run a game before but I've played Exalted before on two previous occasions, I've played in two forum roleplays, and I've played three different Dungeon and Dragon games. My game is mostly a sandbox, and hopefully, character driven game with the idea of annual long storyarcs. The first season is primarily focusing on Solars and the Wyld Hunt, however if you stay with us for a single year, you may reroll a new character from any other Exalted type, as long as that character is of a heroic nature (tragic or ironically so if you choose to play as a Dragonblooded, Abyssal, or Infernal.)<br /> <br /> If you're interested, email me at <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#a9f9daccdccdc6cdc6c7c79ee9eec4c8c0c587cac6c4\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"bfefccdacadbd0dbd0d1d188fff8d2ded6d391dcd0d2\">[email&#160;protected]</span></a>","signature":"<hr class=\"